{{!-- Read-next, after the comments and before the footer.

    Two blocks of 4, not 6 + 6: twelve cards pushed the footer far enough down
    that it was hard to reach, which is the whole reason for the cap.

    Each {{#get}} asks for 5 and read-next.hbs renders 4, so the extra row tells
    it whether a "Show more" link is warranted - no second count query.

    Filters are built from primary_tag.slug, not from {{post.tags}}: Ghost only
    interpolates simple paths into a filter string, and post.tags is an array of
    tag objects, so "tags:[{{post.tags}}]" never resolved to a usable value.

    A post with no tag falls through to the latest-posts block on its own. --}}
{{#is "post"}}
    {{#if post.primary_tag}}
        {{#get "posts" include="authors" filter="tag:{{post.primary_tag.slug}}+id:-{{post.id}}" limit="5" as |next|}}
            {{> "read-next" posts=next tag=post.primary_tag more_url=post.primary_tag.url}}
        {{/get}}

        {{#get "posts" include="authors" filter="tag:-{{post.primary_tag.slug}}+id:-{{post.id}}" limit="5" as |next|}}
            {{> "read-next" posts=next title=(t "Want more") more_url="/page/2/"}}
        {{/get}}
    {{else}}
        {{#get "posts" include="authors" filter="id:-{{post.id}}" limit="5" as |next|}}
            {{> "read-next" posts=next title=(t "Read next") more_url="/page/2/"}}
        {{/get}}
    {{/if}}
{{/is}}
